Z||000010||AL||01-09-2001||11:13 PM||||thanks guys i'm glad you liked it,the car is nice but it will probably get repainted,sitting for 6 yrs kinda of kills the paint but it will do for now.today i connected a batery to it and i disconnected the fuel pump, and dist,so i could crank the engine without starting it, and to my surprise the motor cranked with out any problems,also the lights work and they come up and down easily and the stereo also works even the speakers in the seats work fine, the only thing that didn't work was the windows maybe a fuse or who knows till i work on it this saturday,i will try to give you interior shots of the car,also one more thing the car has a little sticker in the inside of the deck and it saids don't remove,ther is a date also it saids 1/ 4/ 90 does it mean recall work done on it?also did these cars get new engines put in for the recall? <B>AL</B> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/AL_sig.gif">  <BR>    <BR>86 1/2 fastback<BR>84 indy fiero<BR><p>[This message has been edited by AL (edited 01-09-2001).]||||reg||1
